OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'saved' by cancer trial
OL,4,Arides for hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman, who said her life was saved by
OL,7,Fa new treatment for a rare cancer, has
OL,8,Fset herself the challenge of a
OL,9,Flong-distance cycle ride.
OL,11,FJulie Rose, 49, from Bridgwater,
OL,12,FSomerset, was referred to The Royal
OL,13,FMarsden Hospital after being diagnosed
OL,14,Fin 2020 with medullary thyroid cancer.
OL,16,FShe was accepted onto a clinical trial,
OL,17,Fand within six months her tumours had
OL,18,Fshrunk by 60%.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
