OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'saved' by cancer trial
OL,4,Arides for hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe started the 186-mile ride in her
OL,7,Fhome town on Friday and hopes to
OL,8,Fcomplete the challenge by arriving at
OL,9,Fthe London hospital later.
